   537	/// changes the moment validation reports a gap.
   538	///
   539	/// `AuditFix` is deliberately left alone: it routes to `/gsd-audit-fix`, never
   540	/// reaches `execute-phase.md`, and so never meets the sync-clear step.
   650	        )
   651	        .unwrap();
