   332	    limitation stated in this plan's objective, put where a future reader of the test file will
   333	    actually see it before drawing a stronger conclusion than the tests support.
   334	
   335	    Do not add a test asserting that a specific option gets chosen, or that options are reordered.
   336	    No option list exists at render time — DevFlow renders a prompt and never parses a checkpoint
   337	    — so such a test could only assert against a fabricated fixture and would prove nothing about
   338	    the real path.
   339	  </action>
